WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:03.753
<i>Thra...</i>

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:10.385 position:56%
<i>at its center, the Crystal of Truth.</i>

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.221
<i>The source of all life.</i>

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.019
<i>The Skekis have corrupted it...</i>

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.943
<i>and now our world is at risk
from The Darkening.</i>

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.070
What is The Darkening?

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:34.534
<i>Behold.</i>

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.752
<i>I saw something...</i>

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.838
<i>a vision.</i>

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.383
You read too many stories.

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:51.301
No, this was real!

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:58.224
<i>Everything the Skekis ever told us
was a lie...</i>

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:04.397
<i>and now everyone
and everything is at risk.</i>

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:09.903
Join me...

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:14.157
so we may finally unite
as one against our true foe...

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:15.950
<i>the Skekis.</i>

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.787
We are eternal.

00:01:21.706 --> 00:01:23.333
<i>A resistance is forming.</i>

00:01:30.298 --> 00:01:31.716
<i>Are you sure about this?</i>

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.759
<i>No...</i>

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:34.886
<i>but I have hope.</i>

00:01:34.969 --> 00:01:35.804
Yeah!

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:44.103
Behold the power of The Darkening.

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:45.021
No!

00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:49.150
<i>Hope is fragile...</i>

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:51.945
<i>precious.</i>

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:55.448
<i>Hope catches the light...</i>

00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:59.536
<i>splitting the darkness...</i>

00:02:01.412 --> 00:02:04.457
<i>revealing your destiny.</i>

00:02:08.419 --> 00:02:10.839
<i>I don’t think anything
will ever be like it was again.</i>

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:13.925
<i>No, it will be better.</i>

